@startuml "Consultation des événements"

title Consultation des événements

actor "Utilisateur" as User
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

User -> Frontend: Consulter événements
Frontend -> API: GET /api/events
API -> DB: SELECT events WHERE status='published'
DB --> API: events list
API --> Frontend: events data
Frontend --> User: Afficher événements

@enduml